-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §6 עובדי הוראה חדשים: from תשע"ב every new
-- teaching employee is employed under the reform in full, wherever he
-- works; but not one below a third of a position, or without a licence or
-- a degree (save in a field that has no relevant academic education).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `6 עובדי הוראה חדשים`

§§ `6(א)`

-- (א): from the school year תשע"ב, a new teaching employee is employed
-- under the reform in full, even where his school has not applied it yet,
-- or applies it in part. One whom (ב) takes out is employed off the reform:
-- §6 brings no one else under it, and §7(ז)'s "כל עובדי ההוראה" from
-- תשע"ה is read under §7's heading, of existing teaching employees
-- (F-oz-founding-7-a).
@ref akn:art_6__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `the terms section 6 gives a new teaching employee in` y q IS
    IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5772` AND NOT `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` q
    THEN `the Oz reform in full`
    ELSE `off the Oz reform`

§§ `6(ב)`

-- (ב): (א) does not apply to one employed below a third of a position
-- (with the employers, together), or to one not entitled to a permanent
-- licence or a licence to teach, or without an academic degree — save one
-- whose field has no relevant academic education and who holds, or will
-- be given, a permit to teach by the Ministry's instructions. Unlike
-- §7(ח)(2)(ב), it does not save one with technological education.
@ref akn:art_6__para_b
GIVEN q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` q IF
       `employed below a third of a position` q
    OR (    NOT `holds a licence and a degree` q
        AND NOT q's `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit`)

§§ `6 -- illustrations`

GIVEN share IS A NUMBER, licence IS A BOOLEAN, degree IS A BOOLEAN, technological IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
DECIDE `the qualifications of a teacher at` share licence degree technological IS
    `Oz teaching employee's qualifications` WITH
        `position share with the employers, in all` IS share
        `entitled to a permanent teaching licence or a licence to teach` IS licence
        `holds an academic degree` IS degree
        `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit` IS FALSE
        `holds technological education relevant to the field taught` IS technological

#ASSERT `the terms section 6 gives a new teaching employee in` `the school year 5772` (`the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.5 TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
#ASSERT `the terms section 6 gives a new teaching employee in` `the school year 5772` (`the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.3 TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
-- a third of a position exactly is not below a third
#ASSERT NOT `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` (`the qualifications of a teacher at` (1/3) TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- technological education does not save a new teacher without a degree
#ASSERT `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` (`the qualifications of a teacher at` 1 TRUE FALSE TRUE)
